    "text": "thenorthernlight.com\nwebsite\nBlaine\nBlaine school board votes to pause school consolidation\nBy Nolan Baker,\n5 hours agoIn a sudden reversal, the Blaine school board voted unanimously to pause moving first and second grade classes from the primary school building into the elementary school building, originally set to save $600,000 for the 2025-26 school year. During a July 14 special meeting, a packed house of school staff,...",
